# TASK-driven work

- Implement **one TASK** only (`docs/tasks/TASK-NNN-*.md`).
- Read the **entire** current TASK file before changing code or docs.
- Work only inside **Scope** and **Acceptance Criteria**.
- Do not start another TASK id unless the human asks.
- If chat and TASK docs disagree, **fix the docs first**, then implement.
